Extract all line items from this receipt image.

Return a JSON object with this exact structure:
{
  "store_name": "string or null",
  "line_items": [
    {
      "product_name": "string",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_price": 9.90,
      "total_price": 9.90
    }
  ]
}

Rules:
- Include every item on the receipt, one object per line
- Use null for quantity or unit_price if not shown on the receipt
- total_price is the amount actually charged for that line (after any discounts)
- All amounts as decimal numbers in SEK
- product_name in the original language on the receipt
- Return only the JSON object, no prose
